            "detailed_description": "<h1>Oferta especial</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS DINOSAUR FOREST</h2><br>Dinosaur Forest is a fast paced chaotic first person wave-based shooter that pits players equipped with some basic weapons against species currently inhabiting the Unknown Planet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506730/extras/4855a5adc425aea3ba2bdde80d0d711f.avif?t=1747501315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506730/extras_big/4855a5adc425aea3ba2bdde80d0d711f.avif?t=1747501315 width=800 height=500 /></span><br><br>THE SETTING<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506730/extras/426908137c0b216bd8b483a88f0c5848.avif?t=1747501315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506730/extras_big/426908137c0b216bd8b483a88f0c5848.avif?t=1747501315 width=800 height=500 /></span><br><br>The world of dinosaurs is violent and grim.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PLOT</h2><br>The game follows prince Kronoss on his journey to reconnect with reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506730/extras/5e3d4b8847e2df23cd403a0cb2f84f6e.avif?t=1747501315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506730/extras_big/5e3d4b8847e2df23cd403a0cb2f84f6e.avif?t=1747501315 width=800 height=500 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br>340 Achievements<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506730/extras/0a11a66869b34ed9f7815082b12665cd.avif?t=1747501315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/506730/extras_big/0a11a66869b3